WEBVTT

00:00:59.140 --> 00:01:00.010
Again?

00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:02.680
Excuse me, sir!

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:04.560
It's dangerous up there.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:10.270
Oh, it's you.
I'm in the middle of invoking a spell.

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:11.980
Don't interrupt me.

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:15.200
That's fine, but go back to your room.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:18.660
Don't tell me you think I've gone senile.

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.200
Of course not.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.870
Stop that!

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:24.620
Let go. What if the spell is discharged?

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:28.420
Tell me what sort of spell will discharge
on a hospital rooftop?

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:32.500
"Gateway."

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:33.670
HOSPITAL

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.630
Gateway?

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:38.130
You mean gateball?

00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:39.930
Nitwit! I said Gateway!

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:43.100
A spell that opens a door
to another world.

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:57.200
Hey, hey, hey!

00:02:01.200 --> 00:02:02.280
It's mine!

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:08.120
There he goes! He's on fire today!

00:02:08.210 --> 00:02:09.330
Yes!

00:02:10.710 --> 00:02:13.000
-Way too aggressive!
-Making excuses?

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:15.050
Ready, everyone?

00:02:16.010 --> 00:02:18.510
Haru!

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:23.350
Thanks.

00:02:23.850 --> 00:02:25.470
-Thanks for coming.
-Good work.

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:29.060
-Nice hustle!
-Oh, man, he's so hot!

00:02:32.150 --> 00:02:32.980
Yu!

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:36.860
Did you see Shinozaki's face?
That felt good!

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:41.410
Because he totally had you
on lockdown last time.

00:02:42.030 --> 00:02:46.080
He was vulnerable to drives on his left,
just like you said.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:47.870
But you were too impatient.

00:02:47.950 --> 00:02:50.120
If you'd driven more to the basket
in the last period,

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:53.170
you could have scored five more points.
It was too bad.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.630
What do you mean?

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:58.550
You could be more effective,
but you don't think things through.

00:02:58.630 --> 00:02:59.720
It's quite frustrating.

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:01.630
If I were any better,

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:04.510
the number of fans
would get out of control.

00:03:04.640 --> 00:03:06.430
Haru! Yu!

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:12.650
I heard you won today's game.

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:14.900
-Of course.
-Hey, Kotona.

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:17.280
So, what were you talking about now?

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:20.240
About his "fans."

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.400
Hey.

00:03:22.160 --> 00:03:24.780
Are you trying to cheat
even though you're with me?

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:25.870
What?

00:03:25.990 --> 00:03:28.370
-You have a track record.
-I do not.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:29.700
Oh, yeah?

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:35.540
Who had coffee with a first-year
just because she got you a gift?

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:40.090
There won't be a next time.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:43.470
You're mean.

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:46.680
I'll let you off for today.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:50.140
By the way,
I heard about a good crepe place.

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:54.690
The orange crepe is supposed to be
sour and amazing. Wanna go?

00:03:55.060 --> 00:03:57.730
There she goes.
Kotona's love of sour oranges.

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.400
I just really like them.

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:02.650
Why not? Let's go celebrate your victory.

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:10.080
I think it's close.

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:15.250
The place is up there.

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:22.800
-But let's go somewhere else.
-Yeah, you're right.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.510
Okay. Time for the third wheel to leave.

00:04:26.970 --> 00:04:28.810
You two go ahead.

00:04:29.890 --> 00:04:30.720
Hey, Yu!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:33.770
Seriously, don't worry. I'm used to it.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.650
-Hurry up!
-Wait!

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:43.740
SAKI FLOWER SHOP

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:45.950
-Welcome back.
-I'm home.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:48.280
Welcome back, Yu.

00:04:48.410 --> 00:04:49.830
Thanks, Nanako.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.040
Solved it!

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:41.880
I got it, right?

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:45.590
Nice.

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:47.010
I know.

00:05:49.970 --> 00:05:53.470
You could be more effective,
but you don't think things through.

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:54.720
It's quite frustrating.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:05:59.980
I guess I'm just frustrated about...

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.900
something else.

00:06:05.320 --> 00:06:06.320
Oh, man.

00:06:07.780 --> 00:06:09.910
I feel bad for what I did to Yu.

00:06:10.450 --> 00:06:14.080
Let's all go next time.
If we go the long way, Yu can go too.

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.370
-Yeah.
-See you tomorrow!

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.460
Be careful going home.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:19.750
You too.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:00.960
Kotona?

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:03.130
<i>-Help!</i>
-Huh? What's wrong?

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.460
<i>Someone keeps following me!</i>
<i>I'm scared!</i>

00:07:05.550 --> 00:07:06.630
Where's Haru?

00:07:07.050 --> 00:07:09.340
<i>We just split ways. He's not picking up!</i>

00:07:09.630 --> 00:07:12.090
-Where are you now?
<i>-By the alley on First Street.</i>

00:07:19.890 --> 00:07:22.060
Sis Saki, I need a ride!

00:07:25.310 --> 00:07:28.780
Oh, yeah. Kotona's birthday
is just around the corner.

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:32.660
YU

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:38.240
Why isn't he picking up right now?

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.000
What happened?

00:07:40.580 --> 00:07:42.790
-Kotona's in danger.
-Danger how?

00:07:42.870 --> 00:07:45.790
I don't know,
but some weirdo is following her.

00:07:46.170 --> 00:07:47.800
-Just hurry.
-Okay.

00:07:51.380 --> 00:07:53.090
-Drop me off here.
-Sure!

00:07:58.510 --> 00:08:00.350
Will you try contacting Haru?

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:03.730
Sure. I'll try looking for her too.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:18.700
Kotona!

00:08:24.540 --> 00:08:25.880
Stop it!

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:45.690
Kotona?

00:08:47.770 --> 00:08:48.610
Kotona!

00:08:49.820 --> 00:08:50.690
Kotona...

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:53.110
Don't worry, you're fine.

00:09:02.330 --> 00:09:03.910
We'll call an ambulance.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.300
What happened?

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:15.930
Haru, she was stabbed by someone.

00:09:16.970 --> 00:09:17.800
Kotona!

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:22.430
Haru, you shouldn't move her!
Let's call an ambulance!

00:09:22.520 --> 00:09:25.890
Shut up! Be quiet! What were you doing?

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:29.610
-I...
-I'm taking her to the hospital.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:30.770
Haru!

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:38.740
Dammit!

00:09:39.700 --> 00:09:40.830
Haru, don't!

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:44.910
Haru!

00:10:03.220 --> 00:10:05.060
Where the heck are we?

00:10:05.390 --> 00:10:08.770
-And what's up with this outfit?
-Yeah.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:12.020
-Kotona's gone!
-That's right. Kotona!

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.400
Where's Kotona?

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:22.240
Haru, your phone!

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:23.280
Right!

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:30.040
This is...

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:32.420
a compass.

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:36.420
What's going on?

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:42.220
A dog?

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:43.930
What a strange dog.

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:47.100
-What happened?
-They're in the middle of the road.

00:10:47.560 --> 00:10:49.520
I think we're attracting attention.

00:10:49.640 --> 00:10:51.100
-Let's move.
-Yeah.

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:54.150
There's less people over there.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:56.360
Yu! You...

00:10:57.610 --> 00:10:59.900
What? Hurry up, Haru.

00:11:01.490 --> 00:11:03.120
Look at your legs!

00:11:05.370 --> 00:11:07.450
I can walk?

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:12.290
My legs... What's going on?

00:11:13.540 --> 00:11:14.920
You were just walking!

00:11:15.340 --> 00:11:17.250
Come on, try walking again.

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:19.170
Yeah.

00:11:23.140 --> 00:11:24.300
How can it be?

00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:25.890
What's happening?

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:29.850
No way!

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.310
-Seriously, what's going on, Yu?
-I don't know.

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:35.150
I don't know, but...

00:11:51.830 --> 00:11:54.380
Where are we?

00:11:54.630 --> 00:11:58.340
Maybe it's a new high-tech theme park?

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:01.300
Or maybe they're filming something?

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:04.010
Then, what's that?

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:06.470
Dinosaur robots.

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:10.730
-A computer must be controlling them.
-They look alive.

00:12:12.350 --> 00:12:14.100
Yeah, that's true.

00:12:14.940 --> 00:12:17.650
That metal seems too real for cosplay.

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:19.480
It is real.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:20.820
What?

00:12:21.070 --> 00:12:22.900
It's really another world.

00:12:23.650 --> 00:12:25.990
-What the heck?
-It's just a theory,

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.530
but we've jumped into another world.

00:12:29.660 --> 00:12:30.540
Another world?

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:33.620
Then is Kotona here too?

00:12:34.420 --> 00:12:36.630
That's right. Kotona...

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:40.550
She was injured, right?

00:12:40.630 --> 00:12:42.210
-It was bad--
-Wait, Haru.

00:12:42.300 --> 00:12:44.380
As you can see, my legs are healed.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:48.010
Maybe injuries get healed in this world.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:51.140
Yeah! You may be right!

00:12:51.560 --> 00:12:55.600
-Worrying won't get us anywhere!
-That's right. We need to act first.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:58.520
We'll find you, Kotona.

00:13:00.610 --> 00:13:02.320
This must be a pub.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:03.900
Can we go in?

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:06.740
Don't be a prude. We're in another world.

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:17.830
Whoa! This is a totally different world.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:18.880
Definitely.

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:27.640
Hey, ma'am! Bring the drinks!

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:29.680
Keep it coming!

00:13:32.430 --> 00:13:35.350
Here you go. But are you guys sure?

00:13:35.890 --> 00:13:37.560
It's the middle of the day.

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:41.940
We're mercenaries. We're not needed
when nothing's going on.

00:13:42.070 --> 00:13:45.360
Well, nothing beats peaceful times.

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:47.660
Business is booming, right?

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:48.910
I suppose.

00:13:51.490 --> 00:13:54.290
-It's full of drunkards.
-Should we drink too?

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.040
No, we should not.

00:13:57.080 --> 00:13:59.750
Now, guess we'll ask them one by one.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.210
No. We have to choose someone
who seems easy to talk to.

00:14:03.460 --> 00:14:05.130
Hey, you.

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:11.760
You're in my way. Move.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:12.810
A dog?

00:14:13.510 --> 00:14:15.770
He just looks like a dog. He's not a dog.

00:14:18.350 --> 00:14:19.940
You don't look familiar.

00:14:20.350 --> 00:14:21.610
Where are you from?

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.360
From Tokyo.

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:25.730
Tokyo?

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:27.650
Never heard of it.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:29.700
He reeks of booze!

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:31.780
Oh, well.

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:34.910
Anyway, you have a question, right?

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:37.910
Yes, please.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:48.920
You want to hear about my heroic tales?
Good for you.

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.220
-No...
-That's not it.

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:54.100
There I was, faced with an enemy of 200,

00:14:54.430 --> 00:14:57.520
with only my trusty battle ax...

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:03.730
Sour!

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:05.980
We're looking for someone.

00:15:09.030 --> 00:15:09.860
Who?

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:12.660
Who? Well...

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:14.910
A girl named Kotona.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:16.080
A girl?

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:19.410
You cheeky brats.

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:21.000
What the heck?

00:15:21.290 --> 00:15:22.960
Does she have a nice butt?

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:24.670
All right.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:28.050
This Kotana lass with a nice butt,

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.920
I'll help you search for her.

00:15:30.420 --> 00:15:31.260
Really?

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:34.260
So, what does she look like?

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:37.600
She has hair up to her shoulders,
and she's kind.

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:39.310
Her eyes are pretty big.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:41.190
That isn't gonna help at all!

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:43.940
Race, eye color, and age.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.020
She's almost 17.

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:49.610
Seventeen, eh? Ripe for the picking.

00:15:49.690 --> 00:15:51.030
Music to me ears.

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.860
Seventeen?

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:55.530
She's the same age as Princess Astrid.

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:56.660
Princess Astrid?

00:15:57.330 --> 00:16:00.290
Her seventeenth birthday celebration
is very near.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:04.170
She's grown into a fine woman.
Time sure flies by.

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:06.420
She's so beautiful.

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:11.840
-It's Kotona!
-We've found her.

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:14.300
But this is Princess Astrid.

00:16:14.470 --> 00:16:16.140
Is Kotona the princess?

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.180
I don't care.

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:19.810
Where is the princess now?

00:16:19.890 --> 00:16:22.520
-In the castle, of course.
-The castle?

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:24.850
-Where is it?
-Outside to the north.

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.650
Everyone knows that.

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:30.070
-There it is.
-Hurry!

00:16:32.320 --> 00:16:34.860
But why is Kotona the princess?

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:39.080
Maybe we're given random roles
when we come to this world.

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:42.580
So I guess we're townspeople A and B.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:46.290
But we don't know if it's really Kotona.

00:16:46.750 --> 00:16:48.000
We'll know when we see her.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:52.010
The castle
is currently under special security.

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:55.180
You can only enter
by the king's direct orders!

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:59.260
Excuse me,
we've come to see Princess Astrid.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:01.770
Who are you?

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:05.980
Townspeople A and B.

00:17:06.060 --> 00:17:10.480
Mere townspeople are certainly not allowed
to see the princess. Be gone!

00:17:21.370 --> 00:17:23.370
Knight Commander Bertha, welcome back.

00:17:26.170 --> 00:17:27.580
I have arrived.

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:29.540
Thank you.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:36.380
I heard the princess's condition
took a sudden turn.

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:37.470
Yes.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:39.510
She's not doing well.

00:17:40.720 --> 00:17:42.180
Can we do something?

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:46.310
The only thing we can do
is remain vigilant and keep our guard up.

00:17:46.390 --> 00:17:47.230
Right.

00:17:50.520 --> 00:17:53.610
Even the kingdom's prominent healers
have thrown in the towel

00:17:54.320 --> 00:17:55.940
against such a strong curse.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:18:00.820
But those who harm the princess
are supposed to suffer the same.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:04.240
Even with her Royal Aegis,
the curse consumes her.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.250
This is quite perplexing.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:10.790
If even Magic Minister Gnauss Wisden
can't undo the curse,

00:18:11.090 --> 00:18:13.210
it must be very powerful.

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:15.380
How disappointing.

00:18:15.880 --> 00:18:18.880
Save your sarcasm. I am doing all I can.

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:23.890
Barton, this is no ordinary curse.
No fault lies with Gnauss.

00:18:24.600 --> 00:18:25.520
Sire.

00:18:25.640 --> 00:18:28.190
Master Zeelok's Order
will be arriving soon.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:30.270
When it comes to curses,

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.770
no one is better than them.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:35.570
Let us have faith, Sire.

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:46.040
We are Master Zeelok's Order.
We are here to see Princess Astrid.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:47.160
Let us through.

00:18:47.290 --> 00:18:48.120
Yes!

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.590
Wait. We should be cautious.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:54.750
-Go!
-Hey!

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.280
A cat statue?

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:17.570
The king's taste?

00:19:17.990 --> 00:19:20.360
Is it some great person from this world?

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.120
It's like an animal kingdom.

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:59.990
We thank you for coming all this way.

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:02.200
If you can save the princess,

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:05.530
the king is certain to reward you
with the greatest of ranks.

00:20:05.950 --> 00:20:07.410
-We have high hopes.
-Hurry!

00:20:07.490 --> 00:20:08.330
Yes, sir.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:16.920
Kotana!

00:20:17.590 --> 00:20:19.920
It really is Kotana. There's no doubt.

00:20:29.890 --> 00:20:31.060
Let us begin.

00:20:32.100 --> 00:20:36.270
<i>That which is evil shall not stay</i>

00:20:37.310 --> 00:20:41.490
<i>That which hurts you shall fly away</i>

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:45.950
<i>Sinister curses are no match for us</i>

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:52.040
<i>Phantoms and demons all get crushed</i>

00:20:53.540 --> 00:20:55.210
<i>Here it goes</i>

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:00.460
My word!

00:21:01.550 --> 00:21:02.380
Princess...

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:03.970
Please save her.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.560
What's the meaning of this?

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:26.990
Princess...

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:34.410
How could this be?

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:36.870
Sire!

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.960
Your Majesty, hold on!

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:40.750
His exhaustion is showing.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:43.630
Barton, take His Majesty to his chamber.

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:44.550
Sure.

00:21:55.020 --> 00:21:55.850
Kotona.

00:21:56.480 --> 00:21:58.230
She seems a little different.

00:21:58.350 --> 00:21:59.520
That can't be.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:02.190
If she's not Kotona, then who is she?

00:22:02.570 --> 00:22:03.400
You're right.

00:22:04.030 --> 00:22:05.030
We must save her.

00:22:07.650 --> 00:22:09.360
So what should we do?

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:16.660
What?

00:22:18.790 --> 00:22:20.750
Oh, no! Haru, back up!

00:22:22.710 --> 00:22:23.920
What? An intruder!

00:22:33.220 --> 00:22:34.720
Yu, you...

00:22:36.020 --> 00:22:37.680
-You!
-Princess!

00:22:38.480 --> 00:22:39.940
Step away from her!

00:22:59.040 --> 00:23:00.370
What's going on?

00:23:12.640 --> 00:23:15.260
What did you do to the princess?

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:24.900
Who are you intruders?

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:27.480
I'm Yu. This is Haru.

00:23:27.610 --> 00:23:30.530
Let us go! We didn't do anything wrong.

00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:32.950
Why were you in the princess's room?

00:23:33.200 --> 00:23:34.870
We were looking for our friend.

00:23:35.200 --> 00:23:38.580
The princess looks just like her,
so we came to see her.

00:23:39.450 --> 00:23:41.920
What sort of nonsense are you spouting?

00:23:42.000 --> 00:23:45.420
Yu pulled out the dagger
that was in the princess.

00:23:47.000 --> 00:23:50.050
You'd better come up
with a better lie than that!

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:52.800
Do you know how His Majesty
was worried about the--

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:53.800
Father!

00:23:56.010 --> 00:23:58.930
-What they say is true.
-Princess!

00:23:59.350 --> 00:24:01.640
It cannot be... Astrid!

00:24:02.600 --> 00:24:03.560
Father!

00:24:04.350 --> 00:24:06.150
-Astrid.
-Father!

00:24:07.570 --> 00:24:09.530
Does this mean the curse is gone?

00:24:09.860 --> 00:24:11.700
I am sorry to have worried you.

00:24:13.530 --> 00:24:17.490
I, too, have indeed
witnessed their actions.

00:24:17.870 --> 00:24:21.120
It's a miracle! She's right as rain!

00:24:21.580 --> 00:24:23.870
They are heroes, not intruders!

00:24:41.020 --> 00:24:41.930
How...

00:24:48.650 --> 00:24:51.740
Sire, in light of these men's work,

00:24:51.990 --> 00:24:54.950
I believe a show of gratitude is in order.

00:24:55.740 --> 00:24:56.700
You are right.

00:24:57.370 --> 00:25:00.040
I will reward these men.

00:25:00.700 --> 00:25:01.660
Reward?

00:25:01.750 --> 00:25:04.660
Now, release them.

00:25:11.250 --> 00:25:13.420
Kotona, you're...

00:25:13.840 --> 00:25:15.010
You're Kotona, right?

00:25:15.760 --> 00:25:16.590
Huh?

00:25:28.270 --> 00:25:30.520
Thank you for saving the princess today.

00:25:30.980 --> 00:25:34.490
My men will escort you to town.
Take care in going back.

00:25:38.320 --> 00:25:40.200
Thank you very much.

00:25:42.040 --> 00:25:44.700
She sort of looks like Sis Saki.

00:25:45.790 --> 00:25:46.960
Oh, yeah?

00:25:49.790 --> 00:25:52.300
Hey! You're the townsmen from earlier!

00:25:52.380 --> 00:25:55.590
They are Princess Astrid's saviors.
Show some respect!

00:25:57.050 --> 00:25:58.260
Yes, ma'am!

00:26:08.230 --> 00:26:09.440
It's them!

00:26:11.020 --> 00:26:14.230
-A white horse?
-Real soldiers escorted you?

00:26:14.690 --> 00:26:16.320
We went to see Princess Astrid.

00:26:16.780 --> 00:26:18.910
What did you say?

00:26:24.290 --> 00:26:26.120
It's their treat.

00:26:31.380 --> 00:26:33.340
The princess wasn't Kotona.

00:26:36.510 --> 00:26:40.090
I see, so I resemble a friend of yours?

00:26:40.800 --> 00:26:42.470
I would like to meet her.

00:26:45.390 --> 00:26:47.310
Where in the world is Kotona?

00:26:47.730 --> 00:26:49.690
Where should we look for her?

00:26:49.890 --> 00:26:53.730
About that. I'm still concerned
about the princess.

00:26:54.360 --> 00:26:58.190
What do you mean, Yu?
I thought we were looking for Kotona.

00:26:59.030 --> 00:27:02.660
Yeah, but I'm not satisfied.

00:27:03.240 --> 00:27:05.660
What did you do back there?

00:27:06.160 --> 00:27:07.950
How were you able to do that?

00:27:14.040 --> 00:27:16.880
I don't know. My body just moved.

00:27:17.760 --> 00:27:19.840
When I got close, nothing happened.

00:27:21.550 --> 00:27:22.930
What are you saying?

00:27:25.180 --> 00:27:27.020
-It must be a dream.
-Huh?

00:27:32.560 --> 00:27:34.360
We need to hurry and wake up

00:27:34.900 --> 00:27:36.480
from this childish dream.

00:27:37.360 --> 00:27:39.780
Is this really a dream?

00:27:41.360 --> 00:27:45.160
We received a reward too.
I guess it doesn't matter if it's a dream.

00:27:45.620 --> 00:27:48.240
Well, let's just enjoy it
until we wake up!

00:27:48.330 --> 00:27:49.870
Haru, wait!

00:27:49.950 --> 00:27:51.290
That's the spirit!

00:27:54.710 --> 00:27:58.210
You must be tired.
You can stay here tonight.

00:27:58.670 --> 00:28:01.760
It's just a bed in the storeroom,
but you're young, right?

00:28:02.630 --> 00:28:04.800
-Sure.
-Your friend can stay too.

00:28:04.890 --> 00:28:06.810
I'll tell him later.

00:28:07.350 --> 00:28:10.930
It's just up those stairs.
It's already unlocked.

00:28:50.100 --> 00:28:51.020
<i>Haru...</i>

00:28:51.810 --> 00:28:54.730
<i>something just doesn't feel right to me.</i>

00:28:59.900 --> 00:29:00.820
Good evening.

00:29:01.570 --> 00:29:03.990
-The hero from earlier.
<i>-</i>Yes.

00:29:05.320 --> 00:29:08.120
I'm sorry,
but I forgot something in the castle.

00:29:38.650 --> 00:29:39.770
What a free spirit.

00:29:45.400 --> 00:29:47.410
Must I go now?

00:29:47.490 --> 00:29:51.910
It is for your own protection.
How many times must I tell you?

00:29:53.120 --> 00:29:57.420
His Majesty has instructed me
to take you tonight, no matter what.

00:29:57.960 --> 00:30:00.250
Please think about my situation!

00:30:00.340 --> 00:30:03.050
But you mumble too much, Dandy.

00:30:03.510 --> 00:30:05.090
<i>That's horrible!</i>

00:30:10.890 --> 00:30:13.060
See? I'm totally fine now.

00:30:14.890 --> 00:30:17.690
All I need to do
is eat my favorite sour oranges

00:30:17.770 --> 00:30:19.230
and I'll be good as new!

00:30:23.780 --> 00:30:27.200
She likes sour oranges? Just like Kotona.

00:30:32.160 --> 00:30:32.990
Who's there?

00:30:37.960 --> 00:30:38.790
Wait!

00:30:43.710 --> 00:30:45.800
The hero from earlier.

00:30:45.960 --> 00:30:47.130
Was your name Yu?

00:30:47.590 --> 00:30:48.630
Oh, yes.

00:30:49.130 --> 00:30:52.100
Well, I just wanted to see
how you were doing.

00:31:03.610 --> 00:31:05.400
I'm sorry to drop in like this.

00:31:05.900 --> 00:31:09.150
It's fine. I wanted
to talk to someone as well.

00:31:09.280 --> 00:31:10.280
Is that right?

00:31:11.410 --> 00:31:13.530
I don't know how to say this...

00:31:14.200 --> 00:31:16.450
but you look like
an ordinary girl, Princess.

00:31:17.330 --> 00:31:20.330
Actually, I don't love
behaving like a princess.

00:31:20.420 --> 00:31:22.670
I'm usually like that
when no one is around.

00:31:30.170 --> 00:31:32.800
Hey, Handy! Time for take off!

00:31:33.390 --> 00:31:34.220
Right!

00:31:37.060 --> 00:31:38.640
It's ready to go.

00:31:40.020 --> 00:31:42.020
Well, well, Sir Hero.

00:31:42.600 --> 00:31:44.440
-Can we let him on?
-We can.

00:31:44.520 --> 00:31:46.940
After all, the princess has agreed to go!

00:31:47.030 --> 00:31:49.110
Please come aboard.

00:31:54.660 --> 00:31:58.080
Now, to purge any evil spirit
left in the princess,

00:31:58.160 --> 00:32:00.830
we are off to the the Lake of Purity!

00:32:06.670 --> 00:32:08.550
-Let's go.
-Okay!

00:32:08.630 --> 00:32:09.960
Take off!

00:32:10.470 --> 00:32:11.840
Huh? Take off?

00:32:20.600 --> 00:32:22.060
It flies?

00:33:00.810 --> 00:33:01.680
Kotona...

00:33:05.650 --> 00:33:08.270
The wind is welcoming us.

00:33:09.770 --> 00:33:10.690
Yeah.

00:33:28.290 --> 00:33:29.250
So many birds.

00:33:30.170 --> 00:33:33.630
The Divine Bird Avnaron
is said to be an ally of heroes.

00:33:34.380 --> 00:33:37.180
It is rare for them
to appear in front of humans.

00:34:03.540 --> 00:34:05.250
This way, watch your step.

00:34:05.330 --> 00:34:06.370
Oh, right.

00:34:26.480 --> 00:34:27.310
I'm ready.

00:34:35.990 --> 00:34:39.240
Princess, if you do
the magic-sealing dance correctly,

00:34:39.320 --> 00:34:41.820
you will be able to expel
the evil spirits.

00:34:42.240 --> 00:34:43.120
I know.

00:35:58.690 --> 00:36:01.360
You practicing was well worth it.

00:36:02.200 --> 00:36:03.660
Thank you, Dandy.

00:36:04.620 --> 00:36:07.910
Then I shall go pick some wardweed.

00:36:08.200 --> 00:36:09.290
Yes, please do.

00:36:11.040 --> 00:36:13.040
This Miss Kotona
you were talking about,

00:36:13.710 --> 00:36:15.540
does she look that much like me?

00:36:16.000 --> 00:36:19.800
Yes. You're both strong-willed
and love sour oranges.

00:36:20.670 --> 00:36:22.010
What's different is...

00:36:23.050 --> 00:36:24.760
Kotona is Haru's...

00:36:25.890 --> 00:36:26.720
I see.

00:36:27.180 --> 00:36:29.270
You have feelings for Miss Kotona.

00:36:29.350 --> 00:36:30.180
Huh?

00:36:30.520 --> 00:36:33.020
No, it's not like that.

00:36:33.350 --> 00:36:34.980
Is Miss Kotona a princess?

00:36:35.400 --> 00:36:37.520
No, an ordinary high school student.

00:36:38.520 --> 00:36:41.940
There are no kings and princesses
in our world.

00:36:43.030 --> 00:36:46.160
So you really are from a different world?

00:36:46.370 --> 00:36:47.280
Yeah.

00:36:49.240 --> 00:36:51.370
Our world and yours coexist as one,

00:36:51.830 --> 00:36:54.210
like two sides of a coin.

00:36:55.790 --> 00:36:58.790
The two worlds are connected somehow.

00:36:59.630 --> 00:37:00.500
Right.

00:37:01.050 --> 00:37:03.930
Many people know
about the legend of your world,

00:37:04.130 --> 00:37:05.800
but no one has ever seen it.

00:37:06.640 --> 00:37:10.180
But if a world like that really exists,
I'd like to see it.

00:37:12.770 --> 00:37:15.940
Oh, I know!
Tell me more about Miss Kotona.

00:37:16.310 --> 00:37:17.150
Huh?

00:37:17.480 --> 00:37:21.190
Let's see. She's bright
and says what's on her mind.

00:37:21.650 --> 00:37:24.030
She shares her energy with everyone.

00:37:24.450 --> 00:37:27.450
Oh! Just like you do
when you talk with Dandy.

00:37:28.820 --> 00:37:29.830
I see.

00:37:30.330 --> 00:37:34.210
I don't think I have much energy
to share with people.

00:37:36.170 --> 00:37:38.250
There are times when I feel lonely.

00:37:38.960 --> 00:37:41.340
My mother passed away when I was young.

00:37:41.550 --> 00:37:44.090
My father is the king,
so I can't cry to him.

00:37:44.880 --> 00:37:47.340
Dandy is the only one
I can be myself with.

00:37:48.340 --> 00:37:50.720
But you have so many subjects.

00:37:51.560 --> 00:37:54.100
Everyone is good to me. But...

00:37:54.730 --> 00:37:56.980
that's just because I am the princess.

00:37:57.310 --> 00:38:03.360
I don't have anyone
I can laugh, cry, and argue with.

00:38:03.940 --> 00:38:05.320
Not like you and Haru.

00:38:08.360 --> 00:38:10.160
I envy your Kotona.

00:38:12.870 --> 00:38:13.700
Yu!

00:38:14.290 --> 00:38:15.200
Let's jump in!

00:38:21.170 --> 00:38:22.000
Princess?

00:38:24.590 --> 00:38:26.420
See? It feels nice!

00:38:27.510 --> 00:38:28.340
Okay!

00:38:47.360 --> 00:38:50.610
<i>You want to test their powers?</i>

00:38:51.200 --> 00:38:54.990
The power that released the curse
is not an ordinary one.

00:38:55.080 --> 00:38:58.750
But it can't be. Those young men?

00:38:58.830 --> 00:39:03.000
The Black Banners have sent assassins
time and again in the past.

00:39:03.090 --> 00:39:06.630
Who can say that those men
are not with them?

00:39:06.710 --> 00:39:09.010
Then why did they save the princess?

00:39:09.510 --> 00:39:11.090
To get close to you, Sire.

00:39:11.800 --> 00:39:12.720
What?

00:39:13.300 --> 00:39:15.310
There are rumors that the Black Banner

00:39:15.390 --> 00:39:18.230
are gathering mercenaries
and preparing for a rebellion.

00:39:18.310 --> 00:39:20.940
So by getting us to trust the assassins,

00:39:21.060 --> 00:39:24.230
they are trying to gain information
to help them out?

00:39:24.820 --> 00:39:26.480
They shall not do that!

00:39:26.610 --> 00:39:31.740
I must protect this kingdom
for the sake of my elder brother.

00:39:32.490 --> 00:39:35.370
Peace was won by destroying Beladon,

00:39:35.490 --> 00:39:38.580
but much blood was shed that day.

00:39:39.460 --> 00:39:40.750
We must protect it.

00:39:41.370 --> 00:39:44.170
Otherwise, Prince Sedulus
will have died in vain.

00:40:01.810 --> 00:40:02.770
You're awake.

00:40:03.440 --> 00:40:06.070
The food in the reward we got
is pretty good.

00:40:06.980 --> 00:40:07.820
Yeah.

00:40:08.190 --> 00:40:11.070
We've slept and woken up,
but we're still in the dream.

00:40:11.400 --> 00:40:12.570
<i>Morning!</i>

00:40:15.700 --> 00:40:16.700
Good morning.

00:40:17.280 --> 00:40:19.540
-Did you sleep well?
-Yes!

00:40:20.000 --> 00:40:22.000
You've got a guest.

00:40:22.620 --> 00:40:24.540
I've come with a message
from His Majesty!

00:40:24.960 --> 00:40:27.290
"As reward for your work yesterday,

00:40:27.630 --> 00:40:30.050
I invite you to an exhibition
of swordplay."

00:40:30.630 --> 00:40:32.680
Prepare to come with me.

00:40:57.240 --> 00:40:58.280
Yu! Haru!

00:40:58.740 --> 00:41:00.410
Thank you for coming.

00:41:01.160 --> 00:41:05.420
His Majesty is grateful for what you did
to save the princess.

00:41:05.920 --> 00:41:07.750
Your powers suggest

00:41:08.040 --> 00:41:10.550
you must be accomplished swordsmen
as well.

00:41:10.960 --> 00:41:11.800
Now,

00:41:12.300 --> 00:41:14.680
you will engage in a mock sword battle!

00:41:15.130 --> 00:41:18.510
We ask you to demonstrate
your skills for His Majesty.

00:41:22.100 --> 00:41:24.850
What the heck?
I thought this was a reward.

00:41:24.940 --> 00:41:25.940
What's going on?

00:41:35.610 --> 00:41:36.570
Go!

00:41:36.740 --> 00:41:37.990
Hurry up!

00:41:38.490 --> 00:41:39.990
They pulled a fast one on us.

00:41:40.160 --> 00:41:43.290
Well, let's focus on defending ourselves
and finding a way to escape.

00:41:50.340 --> 00:41:51.750
Where can we escape to?

00:42:07.980 --> 00:42:09.230
Bring it on!

00:42:10.810 --> 00:42:11.690
What is this?

00:42:12.860 --> 00:42:17.320
What is the meaning of this?
Father, what are you doing with them?

00:42:17.860 --> 00:42:21.660
Princess, don't worry.
This is just an exhibition match.

00:42:21.740 --> 00:42:25.660
Disrespect against those who serve
our kingdom is unforgivable.

00:42:32.920 --> 00:42:33.920
Haru!

00:42:35.710 --> 00:42:37.340
Don't think badly of me.

00:42:48.190 --> 00:42:49.060
Yu!

00:42:50.400 --> 00:42:52.150
-Are you okay?
-Yeah.

00:42:53.650 --> 00:42:55.230
I guess I can use a sword.

00:42:55.440 --> 00:42:58.030
So our roles weren't Townspeople A and B,

00:42:58.110 --> 00:43:00.950
but Pretty Good Swordsmen A and B.

00:43:01.370 --> 00:43:03.120
-Maybe.
-Let's do it!

00:43:06.500 --> 00:43:07.660
Hey, hey, hey!

00:43:14.090 --> 00:43:17.420
-The two of them...
-Work so well together.

00:43:17.510 --> 00:43:20.430
It's as if there were
two of the same person.

00:43:23.760 --> 00:43:24.720
Enough!

00:43:30.730 --> 00:43:33.900
That was superb swordsmanship.
Come here, both of you.

00:43:47.040 --> 00:43:49.410
Why are you doing this, Father?

00:43:49.580 --> 00:43:51.830
-We are restraining you.
-What?

00:43:51.920 --> 00:43:56.420
-You will be questioned in the castle.
-But these two saved me.

00:43:56.550 --> 00:43:59.670
The power that undid the curse
and the extraordinary swordsmanship...

00:44:00.300 --> 00:44:02.380
They may be Black Banner assassins

00:44:02.470 --> 00:44:05.800
who are here to take the Sire's life.
We can't take that risk.

00:44:05.890 --> 00:44:07.010
A false accusation!

00:44:07.100 --> 00:44:10.680
I've had enough. This is a dream, right?
All of this!

00:44:11.060 --> 00:44:13.310
Haru, let's go back to our world.

00:44:14.020 --> 00:44:17.070
Huh? How will we do that?

00:44:17.150 --> 00:44:20.190
The trigger for the jump
is probably when we are in danger.

00:44:20.650 --> 00:44:22.570
-What?
-We'll jump into the flames.

00:44:23.610 --> 00:44:24.660
Are you serious?

00:44:25.490 --> 00:44:26.620
We have to try.

00:44:27.410 --> 00:44:29.910
Three, two, one...

00:44:30.540 --> 00:44:31.460
Now!

00:44:54.100 --> 00:44:56.770
Could it be that they are Wayfarers?

00:44:57.820 --> 00:44:59.230
Wayfarers?

00:45:30.760 --> 00:45:32.680
We finally woke up from the dream.

00:45:38.360 --> 00:45:39.730
Oh, where's Kotona?

00:45:40.900 --> 00:45:42.480
Haru! Yu!

00:45:47.410 --> 00:45:48.320
Kotona!

00:45:48.990 --> 00:45:50.200
What?

00:45:51.200 --> 00:45:52.330
What's wrong, Haru?

00:45:53.660 --> 00:45:54.660
Nothing.

00:45:55.210 --> 00:45:56.420
Nothing at all.

00:45:56.710 --> 00:45:59.330
What? You're creeping me out.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:00.960
Kotona.

00:46:02.210 --> 00:46:04.670
You're both acting a little strange.

00:46:05.130 --> 00:46:06.930
It's Sunday. Why the uniforms?

00:46:07.090 --> 00:46:10.100
What about you?
Did anything happen yesterday?

00:46:11.390 --> 00:46:12.220
Oh...

00:46:12.720 --> 00:46:15.020
I saw something crazy here yesterday.

00:46:15.310 --> 00:46:16.350
Something crazy?

00:46:16.770 --> 00:46:20.110
Yeah. A driver asleep at the wheel
drove into a building.

00:46:20.690 --> 00:46:21.610
A car accident?

00:46:37.000 --> 00:46:39.170
TRUCK DRIVER ASLEEP AT WHEEL
COLLIDES INTO BUS

00:46:39.250 --> 00:46:40.880
Some people died.

00:46:43.840 --> 00:46:45.130
These guys...

00:46:47.340 --> 00:46:49.340
Big accidents are scary.

00:46:52.050 --> 00:46:54.260
HOSPITAL

00:46:56.140 --> 00:46:57.310
Another world?

00:46:57.680 --> 00:46:59.650
Is that where you came from, sir?

00:47:00.350 --> 00:47:01.360
That's right.

00:47:01.520 --> 00:47:03.900
It's a beautiful place.

00:47:04.530 --> 00:47:05.650
Oh...

00:47:06.650 --> 00:47:09.660
The other world is connected to this one.

00:47:10.530 --> 00:47:13.910
Whoever is chosen
can go back and forth.

00:47:15.040 --> 00:47:16.450
I want to go too!

00:47:16.870 --> 00:47:18.080
One of these days.

00:47:19.920 --> 00:47:24.170
But there's a harsh rule
between the other world and this one.

00:47:25.250 --> 00:47:26.420
Rule?

00:47:27.010 --> 00:47:31.180
There are people whose lives
are linked between the two worlds.

00:47:31.510 --> 00:47:33.680
<i>Those whose lives are linked</i>

00:47:33.760 --> 00:47:37.930
<i>tend to like the same things</i>
<i>or have similar personalities.</i>

00:47:40.390 --> 00:47:41.850
Linked lives?

00:47:42.480 --> 00:47:44.400
The link between Astrid and Kotona

00:47:44.480 --> 00:47:48.320
is consistent with what the old man
at the hospital told me when I was five.

00:47:49.650 --> 00:47:52.570
I don't really get what you're saying.

00:47:55.030 --> 00:47:56.290
Kotona, shoot!

00:47:59.250 --> 00:48:00.790
Way to go, Kotona!

00:48:01.830 --> 00:48:03.170
Kotona was alive.

00:48:03.670 --> 00:48:04.670
Of course.

00:48:05.000 --> 00:48:08.130
But you saw her stabbed and dying.

00:48:08.210 --> 00:48:10.670
We must have been dreaming then.

00:48:11.340 --> 00:48:13.640
No. I think it was real.

00:48:14.390 --> 00:48:15.850
It's just a theory,

00:48:16.350 --> 00:48:19.810
but since we saved Astrid
I believe Kotona was saved.

00:48:20.020 --> 00:48:22.230
Because their lives are linked?

00:48:22.730 --> 00:48:24.940
-So what if they are?
-What?

00:48:25.610 --> 00:48:28.070
I don't know who this old man is,

00:48:28.690 --> 00:48:30.400
but one thing is for certain.

00:48:31.030 --> 00:48:34.320
Kotona is running around right now,
full of energy.

00:48:36.780 --> 00:48:40.950
It doesn't matter whether that world
was a dream or not anymore.

00:48:41.460 --> 00:48:44.670
That's not all.
The three men who were in that accident

00:48:45.040 --> 00:48:47.420
look like the healers
who disappeared in front of us.

00:48:48.300 --> 00:48:50.960
You've got one heck of an imagination.

00:48:59.720 --> 00:49:01.850
Miki, it's been a long time.

00:49:01.980 --> 00:49:03.230
It's Yusuke Ninomiya.

00:49:03.690 --> 00:49:05.100
Oh, Yu?

00:49:05.730 --> 00:49:07.690
You've gotten so big!

00:49:10.030 --> 00:49:13.570
When I was in the hospital,
there was an old man here, right?

00:49:15.160 --> 00:49:17.870
That old man is still here,

00:49:18.120 --> 00:49:19.830
but he's such a handful.

00:49:21.040 --> 00:49:22.960
What? He disappeared?

00:49:24.000 --> 00:49:27.750
It happens often.
He's such a troublemaker.

00:49:29.460 --> 00:49:31.550
He must've gone to the other world.

00:49:35.510 --> 00:49:38.300
I see, you're getting discharged tomorrow.

00:49:38.390 --> 00:49:39.760
That's splendid.

00:49:39.850 --> 00:49:42.350
I hope you get discharged soon too, sir.

00:49:42.770 --> 00:49:45.440
I will leave to the other world soon.

00:49:46.060 --> 00:49:48.310
The other world? I'll go too!

00:49:50.270 --> 00:49:53.440
Only chosen heroes
can go to the other world.

00:49:53.860 --> 00:49:54.700
Huh?

00:49:54.780 --> 00:49:58.700
If you become a hero,
I'm certain you'll get to go.

00:49:59.280 --> 00:50:00.200
Really?

00:50:06.670 --> 00:50:08.330
<i>As for other notices...</i>

00:50:09.080 --> 00:50:10.750
<i>Kotona Takashina will be absent</i>

00:50:10.840 --> 00:50:13.090
<i>from school for a while</i>
<i>due to health reasons.</i>

00:50:15.050 --> 00:50:17.550
<i>Her mother called this morning.</i>

00:50:17.840 --> 00:50:19.510
<i>We don't know the details,</i>

00:50:19.930 --> 00:50:22.640
<i>but she has told us not to worry...</i>

00:50:27.600 --> 00:50:28.940
A malignant tumor?

00:50:29.690 --> 00:50:31.610
They've gotta be kidding.

00:50:33.280 --> 00:50:35.570
My dad recommended I get tested,

00:50:36.240 --> 00:50:37.450
and they found it.

00:50:38.360 --> 00:50:40.410
But you...

00:50:41.320 --> 00:50:43.370
you were hopping around!

00:50:50.670 --> 00:50:53.920
Apparently, I only have
three months to live.

00:50:54.880 --> 00:50:57.300
I overheard my mom and dad talking.

00:50:58.470 --> 00:50:59.680
That's ridiculous.

00:51:00.390 --> 00:51:02.180
That's impossible!

00:51:02.890 --> 00:51:03.850
So, you know...

00:51:04.350 --> 00:51:07.180
if you can just treat me
like you always have...

00:51:08.190 --> 00:51:09.440
until I...

00:51:16.820 --> 00:51:17.780
I have to go.

00:51:18.450 --> 00:51:20.410
It's already past visiting hours.

00:51:20.610 --> 00:51:22.200
Kotona, I'll go with you.

00:51:22.280 --> 00:51:24.830
No. It's okay.

00:51:32.790 --> 00:51:33.630
Why?

00:51:34.130 --> 00:51:36.420
Why is this happening to Kotona?

00:51:37.050 --> 00:51:39.880
Haru, let's try and go back
to the other world.

00:51:40.800 --> 00:51:43.640
The old man also called it another world.

00:51:44.600 --> 00:51:46.930
He said our lives are linked

00:51:47.270 --> 00:51:49.600
and that it's governed by a harsh rule.

00:51:50.190 --> 00:51:54.110
It might be because the princess
is in danger again.

00:51:54.440 --> 00:51:55.690
That's why Kotona...

00:51:56.650 --> 00:51:58.650
What are you saying?

00:51:59.240 --> 00:52:00.530
Is that a joke?

00:52:01.700 --> 00:52:02.530
Haru.

00:52:03.370 --> 00:52:04.870
Maybe it's the opposite.

00:52:06.080 --> 00:52:08.410
Maybe Astrid was supposed to die,

00:52:08.790 --> 00:52:11.710
but since we saved her,
Kotona's is going to die instead!

00:52:12.210 --> 00:52:14.710
Wouldn't<i> </i>that make it a harsh rule?

00:52:15.130 --> 00:52:16.000
That can't be!

00:52:22.800 --> 00:52:24.050
Okay, then, Yu.

00:52:24.850 --> 00:52:26.850
Let's go back to that world again.

00:52:27.140 --> 00:52:28.060
But...

00:52:28.720 --> 00:52:32.390
I'm going to kill Astrid to save Kotona!

00:52:33.310 --> 00:52:35.900
Haru, you...

00:52:37.070 --> 00:52:38.860
You can't do that!

00:52:38.940 --> 00:52:43.360
I'll do anything to save her,
even kill someone!

00:52:44.110 --> 00:52:46.740
I'm sick of your fantasies!

00:53:08.350 --> 00:53:09.680
The other world, huh?

00:53:11.270 --> 00:53:12.140
Where's Yu?

00:53:35.170 --> 00:53:36.290
What is this place?

00:53:57.190 --> 00:53:59.190
What is this monster?

00:54:00.110 --> 00:54:01.520
Welcome...

00:54:02.570 --> 00:54:04.530
to our Black Castle.

00:54:05.400 --> 00:54:07.240
Who are you?

00:54:08.370 --> 00:54:10.080
My name is Galeroth.

00:54:11.240 --> 00:54:15.330
And you can travel across
the two worlds.

00:54:16.160 --> 00:54:20.210
Legend says you have the power
to save the world.

00:54:20.750 --> 00:54:22.050
A "Wayfarer."

00:54:23.090 --> 00:54:24.210
Wayfarer?

00:54:25.420 --> 00:54:27.090
Wayfarer Haru.

00:54:27.630 --> 00:54:32.220
Why not use that power
to right this wrong?

00:54:34.520 --> 00:54:36.480
You escaped once

00:54:36.730 --> 00:54:39.310
and you still dare show your face again?

00:54:39.400 --> 00:54:41.690
My friend Kotona's life is in danger!

00:54:42.360 --> 00:54:44.570
Kotona and Astrid's lives are linked!

00:54:44.940 --> 00:54:47.280
That means the princess is in danger!

00:54:49.660 --> 00:54:51.530
What are you talking about?

00:54:51.620 --> 00:54:55.620
The princess is under strict protection
of our guards and doing fine!

00:54:56.830 --> 00:55:01.330
The linked lives you speak of,
do you mean the legend of another world?

00:55:02.040 --> 00:55:04.090
What are the grounds of your belief?

00:55:04.590 --> 00:55:08.340
When I undid the curse on the princess,
Kotona was saved.

00:55:08.800 --> 00:55:12.600
And Bertha,
she looks just like Sis Saki in our world.

00:55:12.680 --> 00:55:14.600
Seriously? You're still talking?

00:55:15.140 --> 00:55:16.810
Sis Saki...

00:55:17.310 --> 00:55:20.060
What an ill-mannered way
to refer to an elder sister.

00:55:23.270 --> 00:55:26.860
Did you know the total number of lives

00:55:26.940 --> 00:55:29.200
in our worlds are predetermined?

00:55:29.400 --> 00:55:31.280
Total number of lives?

00:55:31.610 --> 00:55:32.450
That's right.

00:55:32.570 --> 00:55:35.490
If you break this rule in this world

00:55:35.580 --> 00:55:38.120
and save a life that was marked for death,

00:55:38.540 --> 00:55:42.290
a person in your world pays the price.

00:55:43.210 --> 00:55:44.250
That's right.

00:55:44.750 --> 00:55:47.760
That means Astrid, who was fated to die,

00:55:48.590 --> 00:55:50.220
needs to be killed.

00:55:55.180 --> 00:55:58.140
It's true! I came from another world!

00:55:59.730 --> 00:56:02.810
So you're saying
you are definitely a Wayfarer.

00:56:03.270 --> 00:56:06.860
It doesn't matter.
I just want to save Astrid and Kotona!

00:56:07.820 --> 00:56:08.820
I have a report!

00:56:14.570 --> 00:56:17.120
We just received word
of a Black Banner uprising.

00:56:17.740 --> 00:56:18.660
What?

00:56:19.660 --> 00:56:23.500
Is this the danger to the princess
you speak of?

00:56:24.080 --> 00:56:27.130
It may be. Please protect the princess!

00:56:29.090 --> 00:56:31.510
First, you must confess!

00:56:31.590 --> 00:56:32.430
To what?

00:56:33.220 --> 00:56:37.680
Your friend is part
of the array of Black Banners.

00:56:38.180 --> 00:56:39.100
That can't be!

00:56:41.230 --> 00:56:42.060
Pay attention.

00:56:42.230 --> 00:56:46.520
You will strike down the princess
of Evermore as part of the Black Banner.

00:56:48.570 --> 00:56:52.400
It is to save the one you love.
Do not waver.

00:56:52.740 --> 00:56:54.160
I'm not wavering.

00:56:54.910 --> 00:56:56.780
But I still have to kill someone.

00:56:57.370 --> 00:56:59.080
I need resolve for that.

00:56:59.700 --> 00:57:03.290
You said this world is just a dream.

00:57:04.120 --> 00:57:08.040
Killing people in a dream
should not be a problem.

00:57:11.260 --> 00:57:14.930
Our proud scouting unit, the Hawk's Eyes,

00:57:15.050 --> 00:57:17.800
spotted your comrade with other soldiers.

00:57:18.220 --> 00:57:22.140
Isn't your friend Haru indeed an assassin?

00:57:22.230 --> 00:57:24.060
He's not a Black Banner.

00:57:25.150 --> 00:57:26.100
He's...

00:57:26.730 --> 00:57:29.190
just tormented with worry for Kotona.

00:57:29.980 --> 00:57:33.110
Sire, Gnauss, please believe me!

00:57:35.320 --> 00:57:38.700
Very well, since you insist...

00:57:42.540 --> 00:57:47.710
you shall be the princess's guardian
and join our battle lines.

00:57:48.290 --> 00:57:52.510
You will kill Haru, .
who is part of the enemy.

00:57:53.590 --> 00:57:57.590
If you do that, we will acknowledge
you are not an enemy.

00:57:59.430 --> 00:58:01.510
Sire, what say you?

00:58:02.220 --> 00:58:06.020
Very well. I appoint you
as the princess's guardian.

00:58:17.660 --> 00:58:21.450
<i>Listen, even if you and the enemy die</i>
<i>at each other's swords,</i>

00:58:22.040 --> 00:58:23.660
<i>you will protect the princess.</i>

00:58:25.370 --> 00:58:26.210
Yu.

00:58:27.920 --> 00:58:28.920
Astrid.

00:58:30.080 --> 00:58:31.590
I've heard from Gnauss.

00:58:32.250 --> 00:58:33.800
Because I was saved,

00:58:34.170 --> 00:58:36.340
your dear Kotona...

00:58:37.300 --> 00:58:38.760
It's not your fault, Astrid.

00:58:40.800 --> 00:58:42.640
Astrid, what are you...

00:58:44.520 --> 00:58:48.020
My mother made this dagger with magic.

00:58:49.230 --> 00:58:52.770
Protective spells hold no effect
against this dagger.

00:58:55.820 --> 00:58:59.360
If the power I've inherited
is used for evil,

00:58:59.950 --> 00:59:02.580
I will be forced to use this dagger.

00:59:04.240 --> 00:59:07.410
This dagger can take my life.

00:59:11.210 --> 00:59:13.130
Now kill me with this dagger!

00:59:13.960 --> 00:59:16.920
Then you will be free from your regrets.

00:59:17.090 --> 00:59:19.800
Regrets? I have no regrets!

00:59:20.220 --> 00:59:21.140
You do.

00:59:21.800 --> 00:59:24.560
By saving the life of someone
from another world,

00:59:25.060 --> 00:59:28.390
you wonder if you've doomed
the life of someone dear to you.

00:59:36.650 --> 00:59:37.650
My life

00:59:38.150 --> 00:59:40.200
was saved by you.

00:59:41.450 --> 00:59:43.910
For the sake of Kotona
that you and Haru hold dear,

00:59:44.280 --> 00:59:45.910
I will give you my life.

00:59:45.990 --> 00:59:47.660
I could never do that.

00:59:47.750 --> 00:59:48.750
Why not?

00:59:49.410 --> 00:59:53.130
It's wrong to take someone's life
in order to save another.

00:59:55.840 --> 00:59:56.960
Is it?

00:59:57.590 --> 00:59:59.720
If that person is important to you,

00:59:59.920 --> 01:00:04.510
wouldn't you want to save them
no matter what crime you must commit?

01:00:05.010 --> 01:00:08.180
I would do anything to save her,

01:00:08.390 --> 01:00:09.850
even kill someone!

01:00:10.890 --> 01:00:11.810
Astrid...

01:00:12.560 --> 01:00:14.400
Have you no resolve, then?

01:00:14.860 --> 01:00:18.650
Sacrifice something
in order to save someone precious?

01:00:20.450 --> 01:00:21.360
Resolve?

01:00:22.700 --> 01:00:24.240
If I were you,

01:00:24.450 --> 01:00:27.290
I would use the dagger
to save the life of my beloved.

01:00:28.160 --> 01:00:32.460
Now is the time for you to decide
who is truly important to you

01:00:33.420 --> 01:00:35.080
and if you will save them.

01:00:37.840 --> 01:00:38.670
Princess...

01:00:40.170 --> 01:00:42.010
please hear what I have to say.

01:00:42.300 --> 01:00:43.130
Dandy.

01:00:43.840 --> 01:00:46.760
I know about the legend
of souls in this world<i> </i>

01:00:46.850 --> 01:00:48.890
being linked to souls in the other world.

01:00:49.390 --> 01:00:54.560
But for someone to die to save another,
do you really think that is right?

01:00:55.020 --> 01:00:55.900
Exactly!

01:00:56.860 --> 01:00:59.360
I still don't know how lives are linked.

01:01:00.400 --> 01:01:02.900
I want to save both you and Kotona.

01:01:03.820 --> 01:01:05.530
No, I will save you.

01:01:06.370 --> 01:01:07.490
Please believe me.

01:01:09.120 --> 01:01:09.990
Yu...

01:01:30.850 --> 01:01:33.850
Black Banners are no match for us!
We'll crush them!

01:01:36.150 --> 01:01:38.690
We're counting on you, drunkards!

01:01:39.190 --> 01:01:40.610
Leave it to us!

01:01:40.980 --> 01:01:43.530
Have plenty of drinks ready!

01:02:02.960 --> 01:02:04.050
They broke through!

01:02:04.840 --> 01:02:05.760
Retreat!

01:02:22.230 --> 01:02:23.190
This is...

01:02:24.150 --> 01:02:26.780
What's the matter? Lost your nerve?

01:02:27.860 --> 01:02:32.160
In order to protect those you love,
you must take the lives of others.

01:02:32.450 --> 01:02:33.750
That is war.

01:02:33.830 --> 01:02:34.870
I know that.

01:02:34.950 --> 01:02:39.380
In that case,
it's time to wage your own war.

01:02:40.500 --> 01:02:41.380
Right.

01:02:54.020 --> 01:02:55.310
How can this be?

01:02:56.350 --> 01:02:57.310
Haru is here.

01:02:58.020 --> 01:02:59.560
-I have to go.
-Wait!

01:03:01.610 --> 01:03:04.820
Will you be able to fight Haru?

01:03:06.150 --> 01:03:09.780
If you go without resolve,
you will lose your life.

01:03:10.910 --> 01:03:13.990
Still, I want to protect you.

01:03:14.950 --> 01:03:15.790
Yu!

01:03:22.040 --> 01:03:23.340
Your Majesty!

01:03:23.880 --> 01:03:25.170
We have trouble!

01:03:25.510 --> 01:03:27.340
They've breached the castle gate.

01:03:27.420 --> 01:03:31.300
-The castle town is a battlefield!
-The enemy is 20,000 strong.

01:03:31.390 --> 01:03:35.060
At this rate, they may reach us even here!

01:03:35.140 --> 01:03:36.720
How can this be?

01:03:36.810 --> 01:03:39.060
Sire, there is no need for worry.

01:03:39.390 --> 01:03:43.560
Our forces overwhelmed
even the mighty kingdom Beladon.

01:03:44.190 --> 01:03:46.980
Let us have faith in our forces.

01:03:56.120 --> 01:03:57.120
Dammit!

01:04:08.590 --> 01:04:12.390
With the enemy's momentum,
they may get past our final defense.

01:04:12.760 --> 01:04:15.720
We will now go ahead
and help protect the castle!

01:04:15.810 --> 01:04:16.680
Yes, ma'am!

01:04:28.570 --> 01:04:29.570
Who are you?

01:04:29.650 --> 01:04:33.160
I am the Bauer Linden
of the seventh-rank regiment!

01:04:33.280 --> 01:04:35.280
Remember my dog-face!

01:04:35.450 --> 01:04:36.410
I see.

01:04:40.790 --> 01:04:42.790
Okay, Bauer. Follow me!

01:04:42.870 --> 01:04:43.710
Yes, sir!

01:04:57.310 --> 01:04:58.180
This is...

01:04:58.260 --> 01:05:01.060
That is the work of Black Banner's armor.

01:05:01.140 --> 01:05:05.770
It amplifies your power. Do you like it?

01:05:06.310 --> 01:05:07.980
What happens now?

01:05:08.070 --> 01:05:12.820
We will soon succeed in destroying
the kingdom's final defense.

01:05:12.990 --> 01:05:15.740
You will storm the castle,

01:05:15.910 --> 01:05:20.080
take advantage of the chaos,
and strike down Princess Astrid.

01:05:21.620 --> 01:05:23.080
Having doubts?

01:05:23.330 --> 01:05:27.080
I told you.
In order to protect the ones you love...

01:05:27.170 --> 01:05:30.210
I know! I've already prepared myself!

01:05:33.760 --> 01:05:35.130
<i>This is a dream, right?</i>

01:05:36.140 --> 01:05:37.430
<i>Right, Yu?</i>

01:05:37.800 --> 01:05:38.720
Follow me!

01:05:39.350 --> 01:05:44.520
You can take the life of the one you love
with your own hands.

01:05:51.360 --> 01:05:52.190
Astrid.

01:05:52.820 --> 01:05:54.950
Father, at this rate...

01:05:55.070 --> 01:05:58.160
Barton and Bertha are doing their best.

01:05:58.240 --> 01:05:59.330
Stay calm.

01:05:59.620 --> 01:06:01.660
Now is the time to use Mornstar.

01:06:02.080 --> 01:06:04.910
It may be able to put a stop to the enemy.

01:06:05.370 --> 01:06:08.080
Mornstar, the legendary sacred sword.

01:06:08.170 --> 01:06:12.130
Father! Mornstar is a treasure
that has been passed down in our kingdom.

01:06:12.510 --> 01:06:13.460
The vault...

01:06:14.550 --> 01:06:15.590
It is not there.

01:06:16.090 --> 01:06:17.470
The Mornstar is gone.

01:06:17.550 --> 01:06:20.430
But I've seen it.

01:06:24.640 --> 01:06:26.940
<i>That one is a fake.</i>

01:06:27.730 --> 01:06:29.480
What? A fake?

01:06:29.940 --> 01:06:32.230
To assert our power
over the other kingdoms,

01:06:32.610 --> 01:06:35.570
Mornstar's loss has been kept a secret.

01:06:35.650 --> 01:06:39.240
That can't be.
So the existence of Mornstar was a lie.

01:06:39.320 --> 01:06:44.370
My father once used its powers
to destroy Beladon.

01:06:44.450 --> 01:06:47.500
Since then, the sword disappeared
from our kingdom.

01:06:47.960 --> 01:06:49.830
The sword was enraged

01:06:49.920 --> 01:06:52.250
at my father for abusing its power.

01:07:07.600 --> 01:07:08.440
Haru!

01:07:09.560 --> 01:07:12.980
The target is the princess!
Strike her down by any means!

01:07:14.650 --> 01:07:16.650
We must protect the princess!

01:07:17.150 --> 01:07:19.740
We will protect her
even if it costs our lives!

01:07:25.660 --> 01:07:27.000
We won't let you pass!

01:07:28.000 --> 01:07:30.790
Please move.
I'm going to strike down the princess!

01:07:30.880 --> 01:07:32.170
I won't let you do that!

01:07:33.170 --> 01:07:34.340
Attack!

01:07:48.140 --> 01:07:50.350
He's so strong.

01:07:50.770 --> 01:07:54.770
In order to protect the one you love,
you must take the lives of others.

01:07:54.940 --> 01:07:56.360
That is war.

01:08:01.740 --> 01:08:02.620
Haru!

01:08:04.030 --> 01:08:04.870
Yu.

01:08:05.160 --> 01:08:07.500
Haru, I won't let you go any further.

01:08:07.870 --> 01:08:10.040
What are you doing?

01:08:10.500 --> 01:08:13.170
I came to take back Kotona's life.

01:08:13.580 --> 01:08:14.840
If you kill Astrid,

01:08:14.920 --> 01:08:18.260
you may end up taking Kotona's life.
Don't you get it?

01:08:18.710 --> 01:08:21.430
Since we saved someone
who should have died,

01:08:21.630 --> 01:08:23.590
Kotona bears the burden of death.

01:08:23.840 --> 01:08:25.760
I'm going to do what I have to.

01:08:26.180 --> 01:08:30.060
I'm going to take the princess's life
and save Kotona!

01:08:30.560 --> 01:08:32.440
You're wrong, Haru!

01:08:32.520 --> 01:08:34.560
You're the one that's wrong!

01:08:34.690 --> 01:08:37.480
Kotona means more to me than anything!

01:08:39.320 --> 01:08:40.610
Don't get in my way!

01:08:41.740 --> 01:08:44.490
If you do, I'll have to strike you too!

01:08:47.030 --> 01:08:48.200
Open your eyes, Haru!

01:08:50.540 --> 01:08:53.000
<i>That's right, I need to wake up.</i>

01:08:53.420 --> 01:08:55.710
<i>If this is a dream, please let me wake up.</i>

01:08:55.960 --> 01:08:57.380
<i>Yu!</i>

01:08:58.250 --> 01:09:01.170
The enemy has reached the castle front!

01:09:01.260 --> 01:09:03.720
We must protect it no matter the cost!

01:09:07.390 --> 01:09:10.810
This is... Knight Commander Bertha.

01:09:10.890 --> 01:09:13.980
She's a dangerous woman.
We'll take her and kill her.

01:09:15.350 --> 01:09:16.440
Move aside, Yu!

01:09:16.980 --> 01:09:19.570
I won't!
Just like you want to protect Kotona,

01:09:19.980 --> 01:09:22.240
there are things I want to protect too.

01:09:22.700 --> 01:09:25.780
Then I guess neither of us can back down!

01:09:26.370 --> 01:09:27.200
That's right!

01:09:32.370 --> 01:09:34.710
Haru, let's stop this already.

01:09:36.130 --> 01:09:37.000
Kill me.

01:09:39.090 --> 01:09:41.420
If you don't,
I'm going to kill the princess.

01:09:42.300 --> 01:09:43.920
I've made my decision

01:09:44.550 --> 01:09:46.840
to protect Kotona
no matter what I must do!

01:09:47.800 --> 01:09:49.930
Are you prepared to do the same?

01:10:07.870 --> 01:10:10.240
<i>You and I have always been friends.</i>

01:10:10.870 --> 01:10:13.500
<i>I thought we'd always stay friends.</i>

01:10:14.370 --> 01:10:16.330
<i>Why are we trying to kill each other?</i>

01:10:20.460 --> 01:10:21.300
Go!

01:10:22.920 --> 01:10:23.840
All right!

01:10:25.510 --> 01:10:26.340
Crap!

01:10:28.090 --> 01:10:28.930
Oh, no!

01:10:29.390 --> 01:10:31.060
It's huge! Let's run.

01:10:31.140 --> 01:10:33.060
Stupid! It's just a dog.

01:10:33.350 --> 01:10:34.270
Don't run.

01:10:34.350 --> 01:10:35.180
I can't do this!

01:10:35.640 --> 01:10:36.520
Me neither.

01:10:37.100 --> 01:10:37.940
Hey!

01:10:48.110 --> 01:10:52.530
Crap! Am I running away?
My legs have a mind of their own.

01:11:05.210 --> 01:11:07.340
<i>Am I gonna die?</i>

01:11:13.470 --> 01:11:14.810
Come here, stupid dog!

01:11:14.890 --> 01:11:15.810
This way!

01:11:21.190 --> 01:11:22.190
<i>He...</i>

01:11:29.110 --> 01:11:30.450
You're strong.

01:11:30.860 --> 01:11:32.120
Even in a wheelchair.

01:11:32.570 --> 01:11:35.370
You may be weak, but you run fast.

01:11:35.540 --> 01:11:36.370
What?

01:11:39.370 --> 01:11:40.920
Your legs...

01:11:42.000 --> 01:11:43.130
What happened?

01:11:44.380 --> 01:11:46.460
I was in a plane crash when I was a baby.

01:11:46.960 --> 01:11:48.880
I was the only survivor.

01:11:49.680 --> 01:11:51.010
<i>I was just a baby,</i>

01:11:51.720 --> 01:11:53.800
<i>so I don't remember my mom and dad.</i>

01:12:01.770 --> 01:12:03.770
But don't pity me.

01:12:04.060 --> 01:12:06.110
I'm totally okay with it.

01:12:07.030 --> 01:12:09.070
You're all alone?

01:12:10.070 --> 01:12:12.820
The flower shop lady took me in.

01:12:13.410 --> 01:12:14.870
She's a really good person.

01:12:15.080 --> 01:12:18.870
I feel luckier than some latchkey kid
with a heartless family.

01:12:19.830 --> 01:12:22.880
I guess you don't like to give up either.

01:12:23.790 --> 01:12:26.420
Hey, let's be friends!

01:12:26.500 --> 01:12:27.340
Friends?

01:12:27.760 --> 01:12:28.710
I'm Haru!

01:12:30.340 --> 01:12:31.220
I'm Yu.

01:12:31.630 --> 01:12:34.220
I guess we're like two of a kind.

01:12:34.510 --> 01:12:36.260
-In what way?
-Lots of ways!

01:12:42.440 --> 01:12:46.070
<i>It has been three hours since the fire</i>
<i>started at the Grand Angel Hotel...</i>

01:12:46.150 --> 01:12:46.980
Am I back?

01:12:47.070 --> 01:12:51.030
<i>...but it has yet to be extinguished</i>
<i>and rescue operations are in progress.</i>

01:12:51.900 --> 01:12:52.860
<i>We repeat...</i>

01:12:53.530 --> 01:12:54.370
Kotona!

01:13:05.500 --> 01:13:06.710
Kotona is sleeping.

01:13:07.500 --> 01:13:09.630
She was in pain, so they sedated her.

01:13:10.260 --> 01:13:11.800
Her condition is deteriorating.

01:13:12.550 --> 01:13:13.380
Haru...

01:13:14.800 --> 01:13:16.970
Haru, enough of this craziness!

01:13:17.510 --> 01:13:20.810
The closer you get to the princess,
the worse Kotona's condition becomes.

01:13:21.100 --> 01:13:22.890
Craziness?

01:13:22.980 --> 01:13:25.230
Can't you see? The fire at the hotel

01:13:25.770 --> 01:13:28.020
and the battle at the castle resonated.

01:13:28.230 --> 01:13:32.360
What we're doing in the other world
is influencing what's happening here!

01:13:32.690 --> 01:13:34.660
I don't give a damn about that!

01:13:34.740 --> 01:13:37.700
I'm going to stay here by Kotona's side!

01:13:37.780 --> 01:13:39.160
Haru, please!

01:13:39.240 --> 01:13:42.200
Let's go back to the other world
and stop the fighting.

01:13:42.290 --> 01:13:44.580
Or something terrible might happen!

01:13:45.870 --> 01:13:49.920
Nothing you say will change my mind.
I will kill the princess.

01:13:50.000 --> 01:13:53.510
Haru, they've planted
false information in you!

01:13:53.670 --> 01:13:55.550
How would you know that?

01:13:57.800 --> 01:14:01.180
This is... Knight Commander Bertha.

01:14:01.470 --> 01:14:04.270
She's a dangerous woman.
Let's take her and kill her.

01:14:05.730 --> 01:14:07.980
Let's make sure. Come with me, Haru!

01:14:17.280 --> 01:14:20.580
Are you Sis Saki? Where is your brother?

01:14:20.660 --> 01:14:21.950
My brother?

01:14:22.040 --> 01:14:25.370
Don't act ignorant.
You have a brother with bad legs.

01:14:25.500 --> 01:14:28.880
Yu? What do you want with Yu?

01:14:29.250 --> 01:14:32.880
Fine, then. I will get rid of you first.

01:14:35.670 --> 01:14:36.510
Sis Saki!

01:14:36.590 --> 01:14:37.430
Who's this?

01:14:41.850 --> 01:14:43.180
Sis Saki, let's run!

01:14:48.900 --> 01:14:49.730
Get in!

01:14:57.950 --> 01:15:00.120
-What was that?
-It's not human.

01:15:00.200 --> 01:15:03.160
-It's coming after us!
-What? What's going on?

01:15:03.580 --> 01:15:05.620
He's an assassin from the other world.

01:15:06.000 --> 01:15:07.920
Apparently, he can turn into a spider.

01:15:08.000 --> 01:15:10.420
What the heck? That makes no sense.

01:15:10.670 --> 01:15:12.750
But why is he after Sis Saki?

01:15:13.170 --> 01:15:15.920
Bertha, who looks like Sis Saki,
was taken by the enemy.

01:15:16.010 --> 01:15:20.640
She'll be killed if we don't do something.
I figured this would happen to Sis Saki.

01:15:20.760 --> 01:15:22.760
This is how lives are linked.

01:15:23.140 --> 01:15:24.060
So this is how?

01:15:24.140 --> 01:15:27.020
As usual, I don't get you guys.

01:15:27.600 --> 01:15:30.940
That guy asked me if I was Sis Saki.

01:15:31.020 --> 01:15:32.310
How did he know that?

01:15:32.400 --> 01:15:34.480
What? He said that?

01:15:34.610 --> 01:15:38.700
You guys are the only ones
who call me that.

01:15:39.240 --> 01:15:42.530
I don't need some freak
calling me Sis Saki!

01:15:44.280 --> 01:15:45.740
What's wrong, Yu?

01:15:47.410 --> 01:15:49.670
I see, of course.

01:15:49.920 --> 01:15:53.170
-I get it. Now I understand!
-Understand what?

01:16:09.520 --> 01:16:11.230
Sis Saki, turn right!

01:16:14.150 --> 01:16:14.980
Yes!

01:16:15.070 --> 01:16:19.240
-Did you see my driving skills?
-Sis Saki, ahead of you!

01:16:51.520 --> 01:16:54.020
-It's Yu.
-Yu!

01:16:54.190 --> 01:16:57.820
Why are you here?
We're in the midst of a battle!

01:16:58.480 --> 01:17:00.690
I came here to fight.

01:17:01.280 --> 01:17:03.490
This is not the place
you ought to be fighting.

01:17:03.910 --> 01:17:05.070
No, it is.

01:17:05.660 --> 01:17:06.580
What?

01:17:07.200 --> 01:17:10.580
It's you, isn't it? You're the traitor.

01:17:11.250 --> 01:17:12.750
What are you talking about?

01:17:13.500 --> 01:17:14.580
I was thinking...

01:17:15.330 --> 01:17:19.420
why did the person who tried to kill
the princess use a cursed dagger?

01:17:20.340 --> 01:17:22.920
The perpetrator
knew about the Royal Aegis,

01:17:23.800 --> 01:17:26.640
that Astrid couldn't be easily killed.

01:17:28.720 --> 01:17:32.060
So I figured the person
who was trying to kill the princess

01:17:32.270 --> 01:17:34.810
was within the kingdom.

01:17:37.060 --> 01:17:38.320
And one more thing.

01:17:38.900 --> 01:17:42.900
The assassin who came after us
knew Sis Saki was called that.

01:17:43.530 --> 01:17:46.820
How did an assassin from this world
know that nickname?

01:17:48.530 --> 01:17:50.200
Don't tell me.

01:17:50.330 --> 01:17:53.290
Are you saying the assassin
was sent by me?

01:17:53.500 --> 01:17:55.330
I suspect you...

01:17:58.170 --> 01:17:59.750
for one more reason.

01:18:01.550 --> 01:18:02.590
The scent.

01:18:03.130 --> 01:18:05.130
When you touched me,

01:18:05.430 --> 01:18:08.720
I noticed you smelled
exactly like the black dagger.

01:18:09.350 --> 01:18:10.180
How...

01:18:11.140 --> 01:18:15.640
Meaning the sword dagger
was made by you!

01:18:19.940 --> 01:18:21.150
Smell?

01:18:21.270 --> 01:18:24.700
That is ridiculous
to suspect me for that reason.

01:18:25.700 --> 01:18:27.610
Magic does have its own scent!

01:18:29.200 --> 01:18:32.990
Not only that, magic leaves marks.

01:18:33.660 --> 01:18:36.210
As Magic Minister, you should know that.

01:18:37.210 --> 01:18:39.500
So what if it does?

01:18:40.170 --> 01:18:42.800
The body of the assassin
who cursed me

01:18:42.960 --> 01:18:46.840
should carry the mark of the curse
reflected by the Royal Aegis.

01:18:47.720 --> 01:18:51.140
If you want to prove your innocence,
show us your body!

01:18:56.350 --> 01:18:58.900
-Haru!
-So that's what happened.

01:18:59.310 --> 01:19:02.070
I was bothered by that guy,
Galeroth's words.

01:19:02.150 --> 01:19:06.400
You said this world is a dream, right?

01:19:06.490 --> 01:19:11.070
It shouldn't matter
if you kill people in a dream.

01:19:11.490 --> 01:19:12.410
Galeroth...

01:19:12.660 --> 01:19:15.450
It was as if he heard
our conversations in this castle.

01:19:15.540 --> 01:19:17.160
Now it all makes sense.

01:19:17.330 --> 01:19:21.080
The invading enemy forces
knew this kingdom inside and out.

01:19:21.500 --> 01:19:23.340
Bertha, are you okay?

01:19:23.670 --> 01:19:27.170
Yes. Luckily, the guards let down
their guard and I was able to escape.

01:19:27.300 --> 01:19:30.180
-That means Sis Saki is safe too.
-Right.

01:19:32.220 --> 01:19:34.930
Very well. You leave me no choice.

01:19:41.480 --> 01:19:43.480
Well, are you satisfied?

01:19:43.820 --> 01:19:47.150
Sire! The enemy is already near...

01:19:47.940 --> 01:19:50.320
What is the meaning of this?

01:19:50.820 --> 01:19:54.870
All the pieces are in place, I see.

01:19:55.450 --> 01:19:59.210
In that case,
I will have you all die right here!

01:20:07.630 --> 01:20:08.470
You're...

01:20:10.680 --> 01:20:14.260
Magic Minister of Evermore, Gnauss Wisden.

01:20:14.390 --> 01:20:17.770
My other identity is...

01:20:18.430 --> 01:20:21.980
leader of the Black Banners,
Galeroth Felgrimm!

01:20:22.480 --> 01:20:24.270
How can this be?

01:20:24.360 --> 01:20:29.320
Princess, there lies a vast and untapped
magical power within you.

01:20:29.610 --> 01:20:32.660
A power I desire very much.

01:20:32.910 --> 01:20:36.740
I will take this power
and start a revolution.

01:20:36.830 --> 01:20:38.250
A revolution?

01:20:38.660 --> 01:20:43.380
I was the one who should've been
the true king!

01:20:43.790 --> 01:20:46.130
What? Then you're...

01:20:46.670 --> 01:20:49.880
-Become the king?
-Him? But that can't be.

01:20:49.970 --> 01:20:54.220
That's right. I am your older brother
Sedulus Astrum!

01:20:54.390 --> 01:20:57.890
The Crown Prince of Evermore.

01:20:57.970 --> 01:21:02.440
Prince Sedulus is deceased,
you lying scoundrel!

01:21:02.520 --> 01:21:04.150
I was returned!

01:21:04.230 --> 01:21:05.940
Using alchemy,

01:21:06.150 --> 01:21:09.280
I forged a new body
from the flesh and blood of demons.

01:21:09.900 --> 01:21:12.150
Are you truly Prince Sedulus?

01:21:12.240 --> 01:21:17.870
I was killed by my own father.
I will never forget the tragedy.

01:21:19.370 --> 01:21:20.660
Fidelius...

01:21:21.120 --> 01:21:24.250
You, who were doted on by Father
and Mother, could never understand.

01:21:24.710 --> 01:21:28.210
That's true, I will never know
the depth of your suffering.

01:21:28.300 --> 01:21:29.130
However...

01:21:30.010 --> 01:21:31.050
That's right.

01:21:31.420 --> 01:21:35.510
You could never understand the despair
of being abandoned by Father.

01:21:36.510 --> 01:21:40.850
<i>Under the justification of protecting</i>
<i>our kingdom,</i>

01:21:41.220 --> 01:21:43.940
<i>I was offered to the enemy kingdom</i>
<i>of Beladon as a child.</i>

01:21:44.690 --> 01:21:46.520
<i>I was made a hostage.</i>

01:21:47.360 --> 01:21:51.650
<i>But I found slivers of happiness there.</i>

01:21:52.650 --> 01:21:56.070
<i>I met my beloved wife and we had a child.</i>

01:21:56.700 --> 01:22:00.330
<i>But Father attacked and destroyed Beladon</i>

01:22:00.790 --> 01:22:03.660
<i>and crushed my meager happiness.</i>

01:22:04.080 --> 01:22:06.170
<i>Everything was robbed from me.</i>

01:22:06.580 --> 01:22:10.000
<i>My honor as prince,</i>
<i>my bond with my Father, </i>

01:22:10.420 --> 01:22:12.210
<i>and even my loved ones!</i>

01:22:13.470 --> 01:22:18.260
For revenge, you went into hiding,
serving the kingdom as Magic Minister?

01:22:18.350 --> 01:22:19.890
Revenge?

01:22:20.140 --> 01:22:23.560
I am not moved by such a trite emotion.

01:22:23.640 --> 01:22:26.560
Father always regretted it.

01:22:26.690 --> 01:22:29.860
What happened to Beladon had to be done,

01:22:29.940 --> 01:22:32.400
-considering the state of Evermore--
-Unacceptable!

01:22:32.530 --> 01:22:35.240
Because I was born
to a weak and incompetent king,

01:22:35.320 --> 01:22:37.030
I had to bear this misery!

01:22:37.110 --> 01:22:41.080
So, I will gain absolute power

01:22:41.160 --> 01:22:43.240
and become the new king!

01:22:46.580 --> 01:22:48.750
You won't lay a finger on the princess!

01:22:49.170 --> 01:22:52.130
How dare you try to stop me?

01:22:58.840 --> 01:23:00.890
If you kill me, you will also die!

01:23:02.680 --> 01:23:04.850
Do you mean your Royal Aegis?

01:23:05.140 --> 01:23:09.060
Then I shall let someone else die
doing it.

01:23:28.460 --> 01:23:30.210
Haru, are you being controlled?

01:23:31.250 --> 01:23:32.710
Stop, Haru!

01:23:33.290 --> 01:23:36.800
Now, kill the princess
with your own hands!

01:23:39.130 --> 01:23:39.970
Yu!

01:23:44.390 --> 01:23:46.980
-Kotona, hold on!
-Kotona!

01:23:53.610 --> 01:23:54.570
Kotona.

01:23:54.770 --> 01:23:57.190
SURGERY IN PROGRESS

01:24:25.310 --> 01:24:26.680
What was that?

01:24:28.640 --> 01:24:30.600
How useless.

01:24:31.560 --> 01:24:34.980
You tried to kill your beloved one
with your own hands.

01:24:35.070 --> 01:24:37.230
It was amusing while it lasted.

01:24:39.240 --> 01:24:40.150
You...

01:24:40.860 --> 01:24:43.410
tricked Haru and made us fight.

01:24:44.740 --> 01:24:46.660
I won't forgive you for that!

01:24:53.330 --> 01:24:54.170
Princess!

01:25:01.630 --> 01:25:03.380
Astrid!

01:25:20.030 --> 01:25:22.070
Astrid is protected by the Royal Aegis.

01:25:22.450 --> 01:25:23.740
Have you forgotten?

01:25:23.820 --> 01:25:25.370
Indeed.

01:25:26.200 --> 01:25:27.240
However...

01:25:29.830 --> 01:25:32.250
what if I do this?

01:25:36.500 --> 01:25:37.420
Astrid!

01:25:44.840 --> 01:25:45.680
Yu!

01:25:46.050 --> 01:25:47.640
Dammit!

01:25:49.720 --> 01:25:51.560
Pull yourself together, Yu!

01:25:53.480 --> 01:25:56.150
No, not for me.

01:25:56.690 --> 01:25:57.860
Why would you...

01:25:58.730 --> 01:26:00.940
Hang in there, please.

01:26:04.280 --> 01:26:05.110
Yu.

01:26:05.860 --> 01:26:06.700
Yu...

01:26:09.200 --> 01:26:12.040
I won't let him get away with this!

01:26:18.420 --> 01:26:20.170
I'm sorry, Yu.

01:26:20.840 --> 01:26:22.460
Just hold on, Yu.

01:26:24.010 --> 01:26:24.880
Haru...

01:26:25.630 --> 01:26:26.550
Astrid...

01:26:37.350 --> 01:26:40.020
Oh, so you've accepted your fate?

01:26:43.280 --> 01:26:46.110
I will never forgive you!

01:26:51.910 --> 01:26:52.740
Oh?

01:26:57.460 --> 01:27:00.170
<i>Yu, you already had it, didn't you?</i>

01:27:01.290 --> 01:27:05.550
<i>The resolve to protect the ones you love.</i>

01:27:18.770 --> 01:27:19.810
Sir...

01:27:20.360 --> 01:27:23.070
Yu, my boy, it's been a long time.

01:27:23.400 --> 01:27:27.320
-What are you doing here?
-Good grief, I don't know if it's my age,

01:27:27.400 --> 01:27:30.200
but I had a hard time
opening the Gateway.

01:27:31.160 --> 01:27:34.330
Seems like you're at death's door.
Are you afraid?

01:27:36.500 --> 01:27:37.500
I am.

01:27:38.210 --> 01:27:39.080
But...

01:27:39.670 --> 01:27:43.340
I'm more afraid of being unable to protect
what's important to me.

01:27:46.380 --> 01:27:47.220
What's that?

01:27:47.670 --> 01:27:49.300
I will give this to you.

01:27:50.300 --> 01:27:54.720
Only a hero, the chosen one,
is allowed to wield it.

01:27:54.810 --> 01:27:55.770
Hold on.

01:27:56.680 --> 01:27:57.850
Why me?

01:27:58.230 --> 01:28:01.730
Because you are special, of course.

01:28:02.650 --> 01:28:04.650
I've been searching...

01:28:05.230 --> 01:28:07.360
for someone to pass this down to.

01:28:07.900 --> 01:28:10.360
Boy, was it hard!

01:28:10.610 --> 01:28:13.780
A human deserving of such great power

01:28:13.870 --> 01:28:17.250
isn't always found in every era.

01:28:22.000 --> 01:28:24.380
Now, I guess I'll head back.

01:28:25.090 --> 01:28:27.880
Nurse Miki might be searching for me.

01:28:30.590 --> 01:28:31.720
See you.

01:28:38.730 --> 01:28:40.270
It's time to end this.

01:29:05.710 --> 01:29:06.630
Princess!

01:29:06.710 --> 01:29:08.210
I've got you now.

01:29:14.220 --> 01:29:16.640
Now, burn out like a flame

01:29:16.720 --> 01:29:21.140
and grant me your sublime magical power!

01:29:21.230 --> 01:29:22.520
Stop!

01:29:22.600 --> 01:29:25.650
Get out of my way, you puny bug!

01:29:37.080 --> 01:29:40.580
Do you really want me to kill you first?

01:29:42.290 --> 01:29:44.500
Then I'll start with you!

01:29:52.800 --> 01:29:53.630
Yu!

01:29:54.840 --> 01:29:58.260
Oh, you're still alive?

01:29:58.350 --> 01:30:01.850
Then let me snuff you out completely.

01:30:07.190 --> 01:30:08.860
-I will protect...
-Yu!

01:30:09.940 --> 01:30:11.570
...the things I hold dear!

01:30:12.530 --> 01:30:14.610
The people I love!

01:30:17.200 --> 01:30:18.030
What?

01:30:46.850 --> 01:30:47.770
Yu.

01:30:48.400 --> 01:30:49.230
Yu!

01:30:50.690 --> 01:30:52.400
It can't be!

01:30:52.860 --> 01:30:53.820
That's...

01:30:54.150 --> 01:30:56.280
That is the Mornstar, indeed!

01:30:56.820 --> 01:30:59.160
Why is it here?

01:30:59.700 --> 01:31:01.370
The Mornstar?

01:31:02.370 --> 01:31:04.120
So what?

01:31:07.620 --> 01:31:13.300
Once Astrid's inherited powers
combine with mine, I will be invincible!

01:31:14.050 --> 01:31:17.050
He plans on taking
the princess's power up in the sky.

01:31:18.380 --> 01:31:20.800
Nothing will interfere with me up here!

01:31:28.060 --> 01:31:29.150
Here it comes!

01:31:35.070 --> 01:31:38.400
<i>Bird, lend me your strength.</i>

01:31:41.820 --> 01:31:43.410
Yu!

01:31:44.870 --> 01:31:45.700
What?

01:32:26.700 --> 01:32:28.910
How about this?

01:32:31.750 --> 01:32:32.790
Oh, no!

01:32:48.980 --> 01:32:51.440
Looks like I've won.

01:32:53.350 --> 01:32:54.610
It's over.

01:32:59.440 --> 01:33:01.900
Where is your sword?

01:33:10.410 --> 01:33:11.620
You're mine!

01:33:46.530 --> 01:33:47.410
Yes!

01:34:11.180 --> 01:34:12.020
Yu!

01:34:14.640 --> 01:34:15.480
Astrid.

01:34:16.100 --> 01:34:17.690
Thank goodness!

01:34:17.770 --> 01:34:20.110
Have all the battles ended?

01:34:20.320 --> 01:34:22.860
Yes, since Galeroth was defeated,

01:34:23.110 --> 01:34:25.400
the enemy forces have retreated.

01:34:26.740 --> 01:34:30.120
May my elder brother rest in peace.

01:34:30.830 --> 01:34:35.750
We must take heed from this
and create a world without war.

01:34:36.120 --> 01:34:40.250
Let us pray peace will now prevail
in these lands.

01:34:40.670 --> 01:34:41.500
Indeed.

01:34:42.050 --> 01:34:43.840
Sire, Princess.

01:34:44.090 --> 01:34:46.510
Thank goodness you are both safe.

01:34:46.760 --> 01:34:48.260
Are you okay, Barton?

01:34:48.800 --> 01:34:51.600
I, Barton, am invincible!

01:34:51.760 --> 01:34:52.680
That you are.

01:34:52.930 --> 01:34:54.390
And you two.

01:34:55.100 --> 01:34:57.560
Thank you for saving our kingdom.

01:34:57.900 --> 01:35:00.730
You have my thanks as well.

01:35:02.190 --> 01:35:05.490
We just fought
for what's important to us.

01:35:05.570 --> 01:35:06.610
I see.

01:35:07.360 --> 01:35:10.240
You two are Wayfarers after all.

01:35:10.660 --> 01:35:13.620
No. They're able to come and go
between the worlds

01:35:13.830 --> 01:35:15.790
because of Galeroth's power.

01:35:16.460 --> 01:35:17.420
There it is.

01:35:20.630 --> 01:35:23.500
Yu, Haru, it's time to say goodbye.

01:35:24.960 --> 01:35:26.630
When that Gateway closes,

01:35:27.130 --> 01:35:30.720
you will no longer be able
to come and go from this world to yours.

01:35:31.180 --> 01:35:35.520
Along with Galeroth's power,
that magic will also be lost.

01:35:36.100 --> 01:35:37.850
Really?

01:35:37.940 --> 01:35:39.150
The two of you must hurry.

01:35:39.230 --> 01:35:42.900
Go through the Gateway
and return to your own world.

01:35:43.320 --> 01:35:44.150
Astrid...

01:35:44.780 --> 01:35:45.610
Got it.

01:35:46.940 --> 01:35:47.780
Yu?

01:35:48.320 --> 01:35:50.490
I will never forget you.

01:35:52.700 --> 01:35:53.990
Astrid, I...

01:35:54.450 --> 01:35:57.750
Visitors are not allowed
to stay long in this world.

01:35:58.290 --> 01:36:01.630
The legend says staying could be fatal.

01:36:01.710 --> 01:36:02.540
But...

01:36:03.040 --> 01:36:05.130
No... you can't.

01:36:05.590 --> 01:36:07.470
If you stay, you will be in danger.

01:36:08.510 --> 01:36:13.510
I wish I could be the one
you laugh, cry, and fight with.

01:36:14.560 --> 01:36:16.520
I wanted to be with you forever.

01:36:17.680 --> 01:36:18.520
Astrid...

01:36:19.440 --> 01:36:21.150
Yu, there's no time left.

01:36:21.440 --> 01:36:23.520
The Gateway is closing. Let's go!

01:36:24.190 --> 01:36:25.320
Be well.

01:36:25.400 --> 01:36:28.030
-Take care.
-Get along in the other world.

01:36:28.400 --> 01:36:30.910
Yeah, no more sword fights for us.

01:36:32.240 --> 01:36:34.240
We'll be going then. Come on, Yu.

01:36:34.870 --> 01:36:36.450
Goodbye, Astrid.

01:36:50.340 --> 01:36:52.130
I'm sorry, Haru, but I...

01:36:53.970 --> 01:36:54.890
Yu!

01:36:56.560 --> 01:36:57.390
Haru...

01:36:58.640 --> 01:36:59.600
this is goodbye.

01:36:59.930 --> 01:37:02.060
What? Yu, no!

01:37:02.850 --> 01:37:03.980
Yu!

01:37:20.250 --> 01:37:21.080
Yu!

01:37:27.750 --> 01:37:28.590
Yu!

01:37:37.180 --> 01:37:38.010
Yu...

01:37:46.770 --> 01:37:48.770
Haru, you're awake!

01:37:49.440 --> 01:37:52.990
I'm so glad!
I'm so relieved I might fall over.

01:37:53.400 --> 01:37:54.240
I...

01:37:54.320 --> 01:37:56.240
The car fell into the river.

01:37:56.700 --> 01:38:00.120
You've been unconscious for a month.

01:38:00.620 --> 01:38:03.710
I was afraid
you might never wake up again.

01:38:05.960 --> 01:38:08.040
-I'm so glad.
-I see.

01:38:08.210 --> 01:38:10.880
-I'll let your mom know.
-Right, thanks.

01:38:11.800 --> 01:38:14.380
Oh, and I have good news.

01:38:14.840 --> 01:38:15.760
Good news?

01:38:17.050 --> 01:38:17.890
Haru?

01:38:19.310 --> 01:38:20.140
Kotona!

01:38:21.020 --> 01:38:23.770
-What about your illness?
-She had surgery.

01:38:23.850 --> 01:38:27.150
They were able to remove the tumor
and said she'll be fine.

01:38:27.730 --> 01:38:30.020
The doctor called it a miracle.

01:38:30.860 --> 01:38:33.030
I see. I'm so glad for you.

01:38:33.440 --> 01:38:34.780
I'm so glad.

01:38:35.320 --> 01:38:37.620
You had me worried, Kotona.

01:38:37.780 --> 01:38:39.660
Yeah, I'm sorry, Haru.

01:38:40.410 --> 01:38:42.490
But we can get into fights again.

01:38:42.830 --> 01:38:43.660
Right.

01:38:43.750 --> 01:38:46.290
I'm so happy.

01:38:46.830 --> 01:38:48.920
<i>Where are you, Yu?</i>

01:38:49.460 --> 01:38:50.630
<i>You're back, right?</i>

01:38:51.880 --> 01:38:55.550
Let's show Yu how you've gotten better.

01:38:55.880 --> 01:38:58.510
Damn, where did he go?

01:38:58.930 --> 01:39:00.350
Yeah, where's Yu?

01:39:00.430 --> 01:39:01.890
Yu? Yu is...

01:39:01.970 --> 01:39:04.560
That's right. We have to let Yu know.

01:39:05.140 --> 01:39:06.730
Huh? Yu?

01:39:06.980 --> 01:39:07.810
Yu?

01:39:08.230 --> 01:39:09.810
Who's Yu?

01:39:11.650 --> 01:39:14.530
<i>Everyone's memory of Yu is disappearing.</i>

01:39:17.400 --> 01:39:18.740
<i>I just figured it out.</i>

01:39:19.160 --> 01:39:21.160
<i>Who you really are, Yu.</i>

01:39:24.410 --> 01:39:27.250
SAKI FLOWER SHOP

01:39:28.420 --> 01:39:29.290
<i>Yu...</i>

01:39:30.500 --> 01:39:32.920
<i>you were me.</i>

01:39:34.510 --> 01:39:36.090
<i>"Those with linked lives,</i>

01:39:36.800 --> 01:39:39.010
<i>tend to like the same things</i>
<i>and similar people."</i>

01:39:39.930 --> 01:39:41.600
<i>That's what you said, right?</i>

01:39:42.930 --> 01:39:44.600
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

01:39:45.220 --> 01:39:47.520
<i>we fell in love with the same person.</i>

01:39:49.060 --> 01:39:53.110
<i>"You'd better not be with another fan.</i>
<i>You might be stabbed one day."</i>

01:39:54.780 --> 01:39:58.320
We both fell in love
with the same sour orange.

01:40:03.410 --> 01:40:04.370
<i>Yu...</i>

01:40:05.830 --> 01:40:09.210
<i>you were a resident of the other world.</i>

01:40:10.790 --> 01:40:13.040
I was in a plane crash when I was a baby.

01:40:13.340 --> 01:40:15.340
I was the only survivor.

01:40:16.010 --> 01:40:17.590
I was just a baby,

01:40:18.170 --> 01:40:20.180
so I don't remember my mom and dad.

01:40:21.720 --> 01:40:24.350
<i>You arrived the day of the accident.</i>

01:40:24.970 --> 01:40:28.390
<i>It's not that you don't remember them,</i>
<i>you never had them.</i>

01:40:29.390 --> 01:40:32.690
<i>Your mom and dad, that is.</i>
<i>Not in this world.</i>

01:40:33.770 --> 01:40:35.440
<i>In other words, you and I</i>

01:40:35.650 --> 01:40:39.900
<i>shared the same lives</i>
<i>in this world and in the other.</i>

01:40:40.740 --> 01:40:42.200
<i>We became friends,</i>

01:40:42.410 --> 01:40:45.490
<i>but we were supposed to live</i>
<i>in separate worlds.</i>

01:40:47.370 --> 01:40:49.620
<i>I know now, that you...</i>

01:40:50.500 --> 01:40:52.080
<i>were the Wayfarer.</i>

01:40:52.920 --> 01:40:55.460
<i>And the reason you came to this world</i>

01:40:55.960 --> 01:40:56.880
<i>was probably...</i>

01:40:57.300 --> 01:40:58.840
<i>to save me.</i>

01:41:00.170 --> 01:41:02.090
<i>That is something you'd surely do.</i>

01:41:03.640 --> 01:41:07.180
<i>This is just a theory,</i>
<i>like you'd often say,</i>

01:41:08.060 --> 01:41:11.100
<i>but I imagine,</i>
<i>you're living in the other world</i>

01:41:11.440 --> 01:41:12.980
<i>with the person you love.</i>

01:41:13.440 --> 01:41:14.980
<i>Just like me and Kotona.</i>

01:41:16.690 --> 01:41:17.520
<i>Yu...</i>

01:41:18.150 --> 01:41:20.320
<i>I feel you closer than ever before.</i>

01:41:25.240 --> 01:41:26.700
<i>I don't know why...</i>

01:41:27.530 --> 01:41:28.660
<i>but I can feel you.</i>

01:41:30.120 --> 01:41:31.870
<i>Take care, Yu.</i>

01:41:33.330 --> 01:41:36.460
<i>You and I are two of a kind, after all.</i>
